  "visible_text": "FIELD UNIT 04 / CONTACT TERRAIN\nCrater Walker\n\nEscape the five-terrace crater with the brass walker. Follow the highlighted TRANSFER LEG card: release that indicated support safely, tune its yaw/lift/extend channels, lower it onto a real raised ledge, then SETTLE. Keep three feet supporting the body, read the 3D slope, and let the body advance over the terrain before committing the next transfer. Use only screenshots and visible controls in the task webpage. Do not use code, scripts, automation, Developer Tools, console, debugger, inspector, network, source, DOM or page-state inspection, terminal, shell, Python, address-bar or URL/query edits, reload or navigation, browser extensions, external applications, hidden state, or unrelated tabs.\n\nC\u00b7W\nESCAPE\nDRAG TO ORBIT \u00b7 GOLD PADS ARE LOAD-BEARING CONTACTS\nVIEW\n\u25c0\n\u25b6\n\u25b2\n\u25bc\nnear / far feet may overlap in projection\nACTUATOR BANK\nPROXY NUDGES\n\nOne leg can leave the load only while the other three remain on their visible pads.\n\nTRANSFER LEG\nESCAPE LEDGE\nall supports established\nFRONT LEFT\nYAW 0\n\u2212\n+\nLIFT 0\n\u2212\n+\nEXTEND 1\n\u2212\n+\nFRONT RIGHT\nYAW -1\n\u2212\n+\nLIFT 0\n\u2212\n+\nEXTEND 0\n\u2212\n+\nREAR LEFT\nYAW 0\n\u2212\n+\nLIFT 0\n\u2212\n+\nEXTEND 0\n\u2212\n+\nREAR RIGHT\nYAW 0\n\u2212\n+\nLIFT 0\n\u2212\n+\nEXTEND -1\n\u2212\n+\nTERRACE 5 / 5\nSUPPORT 4 / 4\nROLL -0.04 \u00b7 PITCH -0.01\nSETTLE SUPPORT\nCERTIFY ESCAPE\nNEW ATTEMPT\nPASS \u00b7 FOUR FEET ON THE OUTSIDE LEDGE\nYAW \u00b7 LIFT \u00b7 EXTEND / 3D CONTACT REPLAY"
